  "description": {
    "text": "The Mewtwo deck of 30-card deck VS set Mewtwo VS Genesect, released on 13 July 2013 and themed on the film Genesect and the Legend Awakened: two ready-built 30-card half decks, one led by Mewtwo and one by Genesect, with a playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers and a battle guide, so two people could play straight away. Mewtwo leads a Psychic deck with Mismagius and Swoobat.",
